libehz
------------------------------------------
Interface to eHZ electricity meters

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/gonium/libehz

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/gonium/libehz.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libehz-0.1.0+git20101025-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libehz-0.1.0+git20101025-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libehz-0.1.0+git20101025-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libehz-0.1.0+git20101025-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libehz)
  /usr/bin/ehzread.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libehz.README
  /usr/share/doc/libehz/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libehz/README

